      "name": "Result questions",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const fmt = (d) => (d ? `${d.slice(8, 10)}/${d.slice(5, 7)}` : '?');\nreturn $input.all().map((i) => {\n  const o = i.json.offer;\n  return {\n    json: {\n      offer_id: o.Id,\n      text: `📊 Offer ended: ${o.title} (${o.offer}, ${fmt(o.launch_date)} to ${fmt(o.ends_on)}).\\n\\nHow did it sell? Reply to this message with sales, revenue and anything you noticed, e.g. \"12 sales, 18tr, most came after the reminder\". It goes into next month's retro.`,\n      ref: `offer:${o.Id}`,\n      purpose: 'result_request',\n    },\n  };\n});"
